{"model": "Arc B580", "video_id": "cOEhFe8qYxw", "comment_id": "UgwPzOmcRntcjCR0hIJ4AaABAg.AEzLNtAeykRAEzMy_8hLKY", "parent_id": "UgwPzOmcRntcjCR0hIJ4AaABAg", "text": "Eh, but unfortunately, I understand that it seems out of this world to test a B580 in 4K, considering that in the real world, no one will use it for 4K (although it can play some light games). But look, evidently, reviews are done just to generate content; otherwise, this type of review wouldn't make sense and wouldn't reflect real-world usage. Also, even reviews of other GPUs at their reference resolutions, if you notice, will never be the real-world usage experience (for example, when they test GPUs only in pure raster).", "author": "@monikaguerra", "author_channel_id": "UC6xQtBM2eMPMkZe_ZHvtpOA", "author_channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@monikaguerra", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "like_count": 0, "is_reply": true, "published_at": "2025-03-13T00:00:00+00:00", "published_text": "", "retrieved_at": "2025-10-12T21:24:10+00:00"}
